#: be0ef4aac11f4d5a8e60f0a67d17865a ca6f2b1063bd40d093b34260d38c83e9
msgid ""
"The board has a builtin voltage sensor and external current monitor inputs. "
"The voltage sensor can handle up to 12S LiPo batteries. The current sensor "
"scale's default range is 120A, but will need to be adjusted according to "
"which sensor is used. These inputs are present on the first ESC connector."
msgstr ""
"该板内置电压传感器和外部电流监测输入。电压传感器最高支持 12S 锂电池。电流传感器量程默认为 120A，需根据所用传感器进行调整。这些输入位于第一个 "
"ESC 连接器上。"

